%description:
Tests tsRecentAfterAckCheck = true, the rule of Linux (tcp_replace_ts_recent() in
tcp_ack()). The tester adds 1000 to the ACK field of the ACK of the server, so
it acknowledges data that the client did not send. The client does not take its
TSval 1202 into TS.Recent, and its ACK in reply echoes 2, the TSval of the
SYN-ACK.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 100"
*.*_tcp.timestampSupport = true
*.cli_tcp.tsRecentAfterAckCheck = true
*.tcptester.script="B2 ackadd 1000"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:101(100) ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1000,2)
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1101 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1202,1000)# changing the ACK field
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1204,2)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Not updating ts_recent: the segment acknowledges unsent data
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
